**Last line of the STATUS FILE, exactly one of:** `RECORDS COMMITTED: records/b1065 @ <sha40> | PR #<n> merged as <sha40> | <1 or 2> C-entries (<numbers>), <n> BACKLOG rows, 1 history entry, 0 catch-up files | Jira: 31 comments, <n> transitions (<keys or none>), 0 creates, 0 edits | SKIPS <...> HELD <...> | PRIOR WORK section present`; `RECORDS PUSHED: ... | PR not landed (<reason>) | ...`; `RECORDS DONE: nothing to push (<reason>) | Jira: ...`; or `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` with ONE question.

